<title>SINGAPORE: L&amp;M suffers loss of S$1.06 mln.</title>
<headline>L&amp;M suffers loss of S$1.06 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in million of Singapore dollar unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)	     (1.06)  vs   0.87</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	  (0.90)  vs   0.60</p>
<p>    Turnover			 171.03   vs 178.85</p>
<p>    Investment/other income	0.31   vs   0.39</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 3.01   vs   2.12</p>
<p>    Associates			 0.24   vs   0.04</p>
<p>    Pretax			     0.60   vs   2.49</p>
<p>    Tax				  1.91   vs   1.69</p>
<p>    Minorities			 0.25   vs   0.06</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		  8.65   vs   0.43</p>
<p>Note- L&amp;M Group Investments Ltd said the extraordinary gain was mainly from the listing of L&amp;M Corp in Malaysia.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
